Milvus Java SDK 2.4.9
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Component: io.milvus:milvus-sdk-java.
License: Apache-2.0 (verified in the published pom).
Used only in full mode (blank MILVUS_URI leaves the client unbuilt).
The SDK ships a bulk writer that pulls the Parquet / Hadoop / cloud-SDK
stack; this project writes through the regular upsert path only, so that
transitive stack is excluded in kb-infrastructure/pom.xml. The exclusion is
a size and dependency-hygiene decision, not a licensing one.
The Milvus server itself is Apache-2.0 and runs as an independent container.

